            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wugwok dwe me Abib, wukwer iye nino madit me Kato pi woro Rwot Lubaŋawu, pien i dwe me Abib yam Rwot Lubaŋawu okwanyowu iye woko ki i Ejipt dyewor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubikwanyo gitum me Kato ki i kin romiwu nyo i kin dyaŋiwu, wutumo bot Rwot i kabedo ma en biyero, ka ma en biketo nyiŋe bedo iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wubicamo mugati ma girubo iye tobi; ento wubicamo mugati ma tobi pe iye pi nino abiro pi po pi atwom ma yam wubedo kwede; pien yam wua ki i lobo Ejipt rucurucu; mumiyo ibipo pi nino ma yam wua kwede ki i lobo Ejipt pi kare me kwowu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobi mo pe myero onen botwu i lobowu ducu pi nino abiro; kadi wa riŋo mo ma ityero me gitum wi otyeno i nino mukwoŋone pe bidoŋ nio wa odiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wubityero gitum me Kato ki i gaŋ mo ma i kin gaŋiwu ma Rwot Lubaŋawu bimiyowu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento wubityero ki i kabedo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu biyero, ka ma en biketo nyiŋe bedo iye, Wubityero gitum me Kato kunnu wi otyeno ma ceŋ cito ka poto-ni, i ca wa ma yam wua kwede ki i Ejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubitedo wucamo i kabedo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu biyero; ci odiko wubia wudok i kemawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubicamo mugati ma tobi pe iye pi nino abicel; i kom nino me abirone wubibedo iye ki cokke madit pi woro Rwot Lubaŋawu; pe wubitiyo iye tic mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
